            "review_title": "Review at Ca Te Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Phương Nguyễn\nNha Trang, Vietnam22 contributions\n0\nBeef with tamarind sauce - not special at all\nFeb 2020\nThe restaurant is quite small and crowded. Its speciality is Beef with tamarind sauce which is really no impressed. And you had to wait quite long for the food. And the gentlement - owner, I guess - was quite over enthusiasm. Honestly I found it difficult to find a good restaurant that could offer good food in Buon Me Thuot, then just try anything you would like to, but do not expect a lot.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 6, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
